,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FJMYD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"390d420e-73dd-4127-b28b-0e78c49ae0b4","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"…って本で読んだ記憶があります","ts":"1629718900.154900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CKEp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db1844a7-9274-42a8-bff8-807904dc276b","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"上弦の月は上旬、下弦の月は下旬にみられます\nつまり上弦の月は満月に向かってでかくなり、下弦の月は新月に向かって小さくなります\nD型の月は*D*ekakunaru、C型の月は*C*hiisakunaruとおぼえましょう","ts":"1629718885.154600","edited":{"user":"U0238G3KV8D","ts":"1629718916.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"first_quarter_moon","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lK0w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecceef8f-cd68-4c78-96c1-0553663d51d4","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"余談ですが、\n新月→朔の月\n半月→上弦の月\n満月→望の月\n半月→下弦の月\nっていう言い方が昔の言い方であります","ts":"1629718143.152900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"last_quarter_moon","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wFx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c719b3c-ca79-4983-a067-f63af860ae86","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なので\n上弦（右半分が暗い＝弦が上にある状態で沈んでいく）\n下弦（左半分が暗い＝弦が下にある状態で沈んでいく）\nといった感じ","ts":"1629717987.151100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NtofR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"718feb39-c2fd-4923-9d7d-519004e8b889","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"えっと、月が沈む際に、弦に見立てられている部分が、上にあるか下にあるかで上下が別れます","ts":"1629717914.149800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j/6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0608901a-15b4-4233-81fc-63fbb2728fc7","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"たまに半月を見るとどっちかな？　と思うけど結局調べずじまいでいました。沈み始めたときに弦が上下のどっちかで覚えとこ。","ts":"1629717793.148600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o+jfs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2984f5a5-e27d-498b-a6cb-225f1ff317e3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"用語として使わないので、あまり気にしてない...w","ts":"1629717562.147400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BkY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09c5ff30-2847-445e-9c12-cb1cfc1b6164","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"諸説あるらしい。\u003chttps://weathernews.jp/s/topics/201802/220075/\u003e","ts":"1629717494.146700","attachments":[{"fallback":"ウェザーニュース: 半月　どっちが上弦の月？下弦の月？","id":1,"title":"半月　どっちが上弦の月？下弦の月？","title_link":"https://weathernews.jp/s/topics/201802/220075/","text":"昔、学校の授業やテスト等で、半月の写真やイラストを見て、上弦の月か下弦の月か聞かれたことはありませんでしたか？ 同じ月なのに、なぜ呼び方が違うの？と思った人も多いハズ。 今日の月は半月ですが、上弦の月・下弦の月、どちらで呼ばれる月なのか？わからなかったり、自信がない人は、下の解説を読んで覚えてくださいね。","image_url":"https://smtgvs.weathernews.jp/s/topics/img/201802/201802220075_top_img_A.png?1519274791","blocks":null,"service_name":"ウェザーニュース","service_icon":"https://smtgvs.weathernews.jp/s/img/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://weathernews.jp/s/topics/201802/220075/","original_url":"https://weathernews.jp/s/topics/201802/220075/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=ck"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AC8543F3-5868-4BEE-BFD2-C12C20955944","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"回ることで、余計にどっちが上か下か分かりにくいw","ts":"1629717486.146500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ap5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5a41369-6e83-4332-8723-112d6fdd2121","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"あれ、回転してるのか。","ts":"1629717382.145500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0qrE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52abb304-8819-4db6-8bda-58816062420c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"直線の部分を弓の弦に見立てているってことしかわかってない","ts":"1629717260.145000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gEi3X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57d962ea-894b-4384-a42b-d8037a81c4d3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"(私もあまりよくはわかってない)","ts":"1629717228.144500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"reSXp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e1e0b0f-6bc4-4f7a-9d3f-ae89a9978383","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"よくわかんないけど上弦下弦ってかっこいいので :yoshi: みたいな気分でいた","ts":"1629717219.144300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S1FG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f669f1c-fa41-406a-aef6-959f0e164599","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u003chttps://pds.exblog.jp/pds/1/201411/13/90/d0006690_18534194.jpg\u003e","ts":"1629717208.143900","attachments":[{"fallback":"641x222px image","id":1,"image_url":"https://pds.exblog.jp/pds/1/201411/13/90/d0006690_18534194.jpg","blocks":null,"from_url":"https://pds.exblog.jp/pds/1/201411/13/90/d0006690_18534194.jpg","original_url":"https://pds.exblog.jp/pds/1/201411/13/90/d0006690_18534194.jpg"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l+2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c4ec38b-ca8f-49bc-a524-82e8ca307765","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"下弦も上弦もどっちも弦は上側だよなと思っているんですが、なんで上下なんでしょう？","ts":"1629716979.143400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K5R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8af75277-dafb-4ce7-9cb7-b619b013d093","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"弦","ts":"1629716846.142700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","